      "line": 1,
      "evidence": "header parameter is joined directly without sanitization.",
      "llm_reasoning": "The original code only considered row data for CSV injection, but the header is also user-controlled input that can trigger formula execution in spreadsheet software.",
      "suggested_fix": "Apply the same sanitization logic to header elements as applied to row cells."
